(text "SDA / SCL on this screen mean SPI MOSI / SCK.\nDo not connect them to sensor I2C GPIO4 / GPIO5.\nAll signal levels are 3.3V. No LCD level shifter.\nGPIO13 and J1 pin22 are intentionally unconnected.\nHeader order is functional: verify the actual module." (at 225 183 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) ) (justify left top) ) (uuid f2a649cc-cbdb-54d0-82e8-0edc12f7d140))
